          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'eat Sulemani deesta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu, aba uhuuda giijeeda Moriya, heeda ghayi ahiimsiina geaw NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdeeda was ghwaan aba heeda ghayi rukuta Dawdi, was mooheeda silakiisa booga bea Aruuna bea eemeeda fuga Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoang'eat deekshooda eaweeteaba iyeenya bea sheedeaba iyeenya bea gweaydeaba ang'wan bea gheambalmeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean suh sindeecheeka gealga ASEETA gil ghayi sin Sulemani. Geawundaanyi gaba geatin laadam nea baraknataanyi gaba geatin diktam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doodooda was madeeda gheeda gaba geatin diktam aba geawundaanyi, gooyang'deay sea baraknataanyi, nea geawundaanyi gal humng'eeda gaba geatin bughala ea diktam. Ng'ata ghamuuw jeeda aba lagheanga miyaasiin meeng'meeng'i siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doodooda geeneaweesa geediga was hoonyaweega ak geemuuwu aba lagheanga dahaabu, ak geeng'oorsa badahuuka geediga miilayga ea munyaloalajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasissa suulga gheeda aba lagheanga haw sheayeat. Nea lagheanga dahaabu gaba Barfaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanoar gheeda aba lagheanga dahaabu, ea darearjeagaaschi, ea daranajeagaaschi, ea ghamardaanyi, ea gidaghuudajeagaaschi, ng'ata gang'oorsa diyeanga dabiniga siguura geeruubajeega aba uhuuda ghamarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadeas heeda ghaydit muuchi, geawundaanyi gooyang'deay sea baraknata, gaba geatin diktam nea baraknataanyi gaba geatin diktam, ng'ata ghamuuwa dahaabu bea dalaantaji bughalaji lah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea durumanacheeka musumaarajeega gaba shekeelajeanjagi ea ghwahita shekeelaji haradam ea damanamughuush bea lagheanga siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeeda gheeda ghaydit muuchi ghwayiin diyean iyeenya siguura geeruubajeega, was geeta sisna beehajeega ak ghoamwaara lagheanga siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea meang'eega geeruubajeega asiyeenya geegala geatin diktam, meang'eedeaba agi geegala geatin muut, ghawas ghamarda gheeda, nea meang'eeda niirja, sigala geatin muudiin, ghawas meang'eeda diyeaydeaba iyeenya bea dabiniga siguura geeruubajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea meang'eeda diyeaydeaba iyeenya bea dabiniga siguura geeruubajeanda, geegala geatin muut, nea ghoang'waay geat sea meang'eeda dea madeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea meang'eegeaba diyeang'su asiyeenyean bea dabinigean geamiinda ak gaba geatin diktam, ghamiinaada aba badahuuka geeshanga nyaawa ak gang'ula bwadaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin hang'da oomu, ea dea meajea oomu, ea dea areara, ea hang'da bumbuni, ng'ata gwasin diyeanga dabiniga siguura geeruubajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'udan iyeenya bea gharinga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinda daranaji iyeenya aba madeeda gheeda, geawunyeeka nyaawa geegala geatin diktam ea damanamughuush, nea surumga mida iheenga nyaawa geegala geatin samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin munyaloalajeega aba jeeda gheeda mida jih, ak ghwayiin iheenga daranajeega, ak gwasin goomamaangaji bughala, ak ghwayiin uhuuda surumga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda daranajeega aba madeeda gheeda sibatiisa ASEETA, agi gwanda geatinda dugwa ak niirja gwanda geatinda ghaadaam, dea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara gaguura Yakini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yakini: Gideabeadaanyi geaghay gideaba gaygwasikteawa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ak ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gaguura Boasi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Boasi: Gideabeadaanyi geaghay gideaba gwanda uurda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
